{"c":[{"id":"24a976c12b8a54f1","sum":"D2-06/B30: GoalRuns.blocked (inside Helper.authorize) must return null once a segment ends, or undo is refused. A goal host's Ask with route plan comes back as AskGoal (planAsk goals:true) for helper.offerGoal; other consumers keep planTask/planWithCode.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T105431Z-2d9978b4db29946e","text":"D2-06: GoalRuns.blocked runs inside Helper.authorize before every act; it must return null once a segment ends, or a goal task's undo (undoBlocked -> authorize) is refused.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T120548Z-9e86109ce30422ae","text":"B30: a goal-planning host's Ask with route plan is offered as a D2-06 goal (planAsk goals:true returns AskGoal; helper.offerGoal); other consumers keep planTask/planWithCode. planAsk overloads: goals absent/false types as AskDraft.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b7329c13cd423b17","sum":"B30: keep name patterns case-sensitive (the i flag folds \\p{Lu}). Goal writes never touch Cc/Bcc or Subject; To takes only the From of the message the reply answers, rechecked at accept (drafts.ts senderOf); D2-06 scenes need mailWindow line 0 to be From.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T120548Z-b6135cb945f89335","text":"B30: JS regex with the i flag folds \\p{Lu} to match lower case too; a case-insensitive name pattern let 'Thanks, I'll pay' skip Jev. Keep name patterns case-sensitive.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T120548Z-c27c662d572bf540","text":"B30: goal writes never touch Cc/Bcc or Subject, and To takes only the From address in the header block of the message the reply window answers (Re: <subject>), rechecked at accept (drafts.ts senderOf). D2-06 scenes rely on mailWindow line 0 being its From header.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
